# Game_Target — Target Touch (ID 15)
# Files: src/coordinator/Game_Target.h, Game_Target.cpp
# HTML: data/game_target_setup.html, game_target_names.html, game_target_run.html

## GAMEPLAY
Speed game: pucks light up, players touch targets. 1-5 groups, 2-10 pucks/group.
Two modes: Time-based (fixed duration, highest score) or Round-based (first to N wins).
Sequential or random target selection. Optional group start button.

## CONFIG
- numGroups (1-5), pucksPerGroup (2-10), delayMs (default 2s between targets)
- gameMode: 0=Time, 1=Rounds
- timeLimit (default 120s), targetRounds (default 30)
- seqMode: 0=Random, 1=Sequence
- groupStart: require hold on puck 0

## STATES per group
TG_SETUP → TG_WAIT_HANDS → TG_COUNTDOWN (3s, SKI) → TG_RUNNING → TG_FINISHED
Optional: TG_FALSE_START (2s)

## KEY MECHANICS
- Random: avoids same puck twice (lastPuckIdx tracking)
- Sequence: cycling through pucks in order
- Active target: EFF_STATIC in group color with beep
- evaluateWinners(): called when ALL groups finish
  - Time mode: highest score wins
  - Round mode: fastest to target wins (tiebreak on time)
- Colors: Magenta, Cyan, Yellow, Lime, DeepPink

## COMMANDS
setup, cfg_groups, cfg_pucks, cfg_delay, cfg_mode, cfg_time, cfg_rounds, cfg_seq, cfg_grpstart,
start, reset, stop, exit, grp_start_X, grp_stop_X

## STATUS JSON
{mode, lim, groups: [{id, st, sc, hld, fs, time}]}
